<title>RUSSIA: Rouble eases to 5,415 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble eases to 5,415 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble eased to 5,415 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,413 on Thursday. Dealers said the central bank sold $3.26 million to close trading.</p>
<p>				    Oct 4		   Oct 3</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,415		   5,413</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	11.61		   13.09</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
